+### If a live step is refused or impossible
+
+The policy for this project is build-only. If a session cannot run a live step (no `WAYLAND_DISPLAY`, an auto-mode
+refusal, a dialog it cannot clear), it marks the step skipped in its progress entry and leaves Michael this
+sequence, each stage checked before the next:
+
+1. Dry run: `npm test` green (the stubbed tests are the dry run of every tool).
+2. Sink only: `tools/null-sink up && pactl list short sinks && pactl info | grep 'Default Sink'`. Undo:
+   `tools/null-sink down`.
+3. Mixxx on the null sink, mapping not yet installed: `tools/mixxx-dev start`, `pactl list sink-inputs`,
+   `tools/mixxx-dev log`. Undo: `tools/mixxx-dev stop`.
+4. Mapping on Midi Through: `tools/install-mapping`, restart, replay `tests/fixtures/three-notes.mid`, read the
+   log. Undo: `tools/mixxx-dev stop && tools/null-sink down`; `rm -r ~/.var/app/org.mixxx.Mixxx/dev-profile`
+   resets everything (it holds nothing of Michael's).
